    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d326-a1">

                <pb facs="0371" n="337" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg337"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    148.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Munoz to Mr.
                            Pringle.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Palacio Nacional</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-07-29"><hi rendition="#italic">July 29,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Honorable Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit to
                    you the order issued yesterday: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>The President of the Republic has ordered the exequatur of Mr. Florentin
                            Souza, United States consular agent, in the port of Champerico,
                            withdrawn.</p>
                        <p>Let it be known.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reyna Barrios.</hi></p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jorge Munoz</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I embrace this opportunity, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jorge Muñoz.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
